[02:14] [scene:features]
VISUAL: Text slide: "The Local AI Shelf" listing features like background removal, upscaling, OCR, transcription.
AUDIO: 'and auto-generate video subtitles. All of it runs on your hardware with no internet required. The built-in fast OCR adds about 25 MB to the image, and the heavier accuracy pack installs only if'

